          "text": "Memory Wall\n\nCapacity, Bandwidth, and Latency\n\n\n\n\n\n Adapted from: K. K. Chang, “Understanding and Improving DRAM Latency,” Ph.D.\n                            dissertation, CMU, 2017, Fig. 1.1.\n\n  Trends of bandwidth and latency are worsen.\n\n\nMemory Wall     CPU Memory     GPU Memory    SOTA Memory     Advanced AI Computing and Systems        10",
